WEBVTT

00:00:01.200 --> 00:00:04.211
Every community starts the same way.

00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:07.550
A few people. And a reason to get
together.

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:09.587
A book club. A rope circle.

00:00:09.587 --> 00:00:12.372
A Sunday picnic. A basement gig.

00:00:13.325 --> 00:00:16.685
Then come the platforms. Fees on every
ticket.

00:00:16.685 --> 00:00:19.292
Your people, turned into data.

00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:21.446
Revel is different.

00:00:22.300 --> 00:00:26.950
It's open source. Anyone can read it, run
it, and make it better.

00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:28.807
Buyers pay the ticket price.

00:00:28.807 --> 00:00:30.350
No fee on top.

00:00:30.400 --> 00:00:33.550
The money goes straight to the organizer.

00:00:33.600 --> 00:00:38.653
No ads. No trackers. And your data is
never, ever sold.

00:00:39.933 --> 00:00:42.550
Some rooms need a little more care.

00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:46.116
Like a rope workshop in Vienna, built on
trust.

00:00:46.452 --> 00:00:50.461
So before anyone gets a ticket, they
answer a few questions.

00:00:50.511 --> 00:00:55.081
About experience, the consent guidelines,
and why they want to come.

00:00:57.300 --> 00:01:01.700
Then a real person reads every answer, and
makes the call.

00:01:03.241 --> 00:01:05.325
And then, you're in.

00:01:06.200 --> 00:01:08.910
Everyone in the room chose to be there.

00:01:08.960 --> 00:01:11.368
And was welcomed with care.

00:01:12.056 --> 00:01:13.530
Potlucks.

00:01:13.692 --> 00:01:15.278
Member pricing.

00:01:15.328 --> 00:01:16.943
Pay what you can.

00:01:17.510 --> 00:01:19.051
Wait lists.

00:01:19.691 --> 00:01:21.278
Check in at the door.

00:01:21.328 --> 00:01:23.411
In six languages.

00:01:24.089 --> 00:01:29.609
Revel, the free, open source event
platform for communities, clubs and
independent

00:01:29.609 --> 00:01:31.027
venues.

00:01:31.821 --> 00:01:33.301
Let's revel.

